        ('machine-time-viewer', 'Machine Fragment: Temporal Viewer', ['physics.optics', 'history.ancient-civilizations'], 22, 'An ancient device shows vivid scenes from the past that appear historically accurate.', _4step('observe','View three different historical scenes and document what is shown.','Record details about clothing, technology, and activities.','compare','Cross-reference the scenes with known historical records.','Check if the depicted details match documented history.','measure','Determine the chronological range of scenes the device can show.','View scenes from different eras and note the earliest and latest.','experiment','Test whether the viewer shows events not recorded in any known document.','Look for details that could be independently verified.')),
        ('machine-time-echo', 'Machine Fragment: Sound Echo', ['physics.waves', 'history.us-constitution'], 22, 'Certain locations replay historical sounds when activated by the ancient device.', _4step('observe','Document the sounds replayed at five different locations.','Note the language, tone, and content of each sound.','decode','Identify the historical period and context of each replayed sound.','Use language and references to date each recording.','compare','Cross-reference identified sounds with historical accounts.','Do the sounds match what we know about those events?','measure','Determine if the sound quality degrades for older events.','Compare clarity and volume across different historical periods.')),
        ('machine-time-artifact', 'Machine Fragment: Preservation Field', ['chemistry.reactions', 'history.ancient-civilizations'], 22, 'An ancient field preserves objects in their original state regardless of age.', _4step('observe','Examine objects within the preservation field and note their condition.','Compare to similar objects outside the field.','measure','Test the age of preserved objects using standard dating methods.','The dating should show ancient age but the condition should appear new.','experiment','Place a modern object partially in and out of the field over time.','Compare the aging of the portions inside and outside.','compare','Compare the preservation to modern conservation techniques.','Museum conservation slows decay; this apparently stops it.')),
        ('machine-time-calendar', 'Machine Fragment: Multi-Era Calendar', ['math.patterns', 'history.ancient-civilizations'], 22, 'An ancient calendar simultaneously displays accurate dates in multiple calendar systems.', _4step('observe','Read the calendar and identify which calendar systems are displayed.','Look for Gregorian, Julian, lunar, and unknown systems.','solve','Verify the calendar accuracy by calculating dates in known systems.','Check that the displayed dates match calculated values.','compare','Compare the precision of the ancient calendar to modern atomic timekeeping.','Calculate drift over centuries for each system.','decode','Identify any calendar systems displayed that are not recognized.','Look for patterns that could define an unknown time-reckoning system.')),
